@attribute [Route(GlobalValues.Path_Theming_CSS_Unit_Variables)]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Page_Title_Theming_CSS_Unit_Variables</PageTitle>

<h1 class="page-heading">@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Theming_CSS_Unit_Variables</h1>

<p>
    The following tables contain all of the unit type css variables that can be used by the base variables.
    Theses included such things as the units for border widths, font-sizes, weights, colours, opacity values etc. 
</p>

